        <source>Single node container root, the owner scope of nested items and node content.</source>
        <target state="translated">單個節點容器本身，作為子節點與節點內容的 owner 作用域。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Use owner-scoped selectors and generated Semantic Part styles to customize the published node container, switcher, icon and title parts.</source>
        <target state="translated">使用 owner 作用域選擇器與生成的 Semantic Part 樣式，定制已發布的節點容器、switcher、圖示與標題 Part。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
